## Fixes

**Color / tokens**
1. `.card` background `#ffffff` → `var(--color-surface-default)` (R-ui-polish-20).
2. `.card` border color `#e5e7eb` → `var(--color-border-default)`; no exact token match exists for this hex (drift, see Open questions), but the role is a default divider border, so the border-role token replaces it.
3. `.card h2` color `#111827` → `var(--color-text-default)` — 14.55:1 on white, still passes rule 4.
4. `.card p` color `#999999` → `var(--color-text-muted)`. The original failed contrast (2.85:1, below 4.5:1); the token passes at 6.93:1 (rule 4, rule 27 — this is a genuine improvement, not a lowering).
5. `.card button` (Pay now) background `#0d9488` → `var(--color-action-primary-bg)`. Plain `#0d9488` (`--color-brand`) on white text is only 3.74:1 per the design-system report, below 4.5:1; the primary-action token (`primary-800`, `#0b7067`) reaches 5.95:1 (rule 21, rule 4).
6. `.card button` (Pay now) text `#fff` → `var(--color-action-primary-text)`.
7. Second button ("Download PDF") restyled as the secondary action (rule 5 — one primary action per view): background removed, `color: var(--color-action-secondary-text)`, `border: var(--border-width-hairline) solid var(--color-action-secondary-border)`, background `var(--color-surface-default)`.

**Spacing**
8. `.card` padding `13px` → `var(--space-16)` (nearest on-scale value; 13px is not on the 4/8/12/16/24… scale, rule 1).
9. `.card h2` margin `0 0 5px` → `0 0 var(--space-8)` (5px is off-scale; nearest step is 8px, rule 1).
10. Button internal spacing `6px 10px` → `var(--space-8) var(--space-16)` (off-scale values replaced; rule 1), with a gap of `var(--space-8)` added between the two buttons (was touching, no gap token).

**Type**
11. `.card h2` font-size `22px` → `var(--font-size-xl)` (24px; 22px is off-scale, rule 2), line-height set to `var(--line-height-heading)` (rule 3, headings need 1.2–1.3).
12. `.card p` font-size `13px` → `var(--font-size-md)` (16px; body text must be ≥16px, rule 2), line-height `var(--line-height-body)` (1.5, rule 3).
13. `font-family: system-ui` → `var(--font-family-sans)` (same stack, now tokenized).

**Radius / border**
14. `.card` and buttons `border-radius: 5px` → `var(--radius-sm)` (6px; 5px is off-scale — the token file's radius scale is 6/10/16, rule 1 extended to radius via rule 20).

**States & targets**
15. Added `:hover`, `:focus-visible` (2px outline using `var(--color-border-focus)`), and `min-height: var(--control-height-md)` (44px) on both buttons — none existed before (rule 6, rule 7).
16. Added `@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)` guard around the new hover/focus transition (rule 9).

